# One pet life, two kinds of verb (D69, 2026-11-10).
# world = the skyland: dig, haul, place, and later plant. Columns with height.
# table = Teropoly: talk, offer, buy, build (a house on a street). Not a chapel stone.
# A table row must not name app crew or df-hq. A world row must not name deskopoly.
# OPEN means the verb is not invented here. Add a row. Do not add a C branch.
# ROUTE | life | kind | app | verb | check
ROUTE | mine | world | df-hq | dig | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | place | world | crew | place | -
ROUTE | haul | world | OPEN | haul | -
ROUTE | farm | world | OPEN | plant | -
ROUTE | talk | table | deskopoly | talk | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | offer | table | deskopoly | offer | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | buy | table | deskopoly | buy | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | build | table | deskopoly | build | verbs.pdl
